ck;padding:14px 22px;background:#173dc6;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px">View your order</a></p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7">Your order page shows the latest status and any tracking reference added after dispatch. For help, reply to this email.</p><p style="font-size:12px;color:#777">Keep this email for your records. This is an order confirmation, not a tax invoice.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>
